 of the last Ziyadid who founded the Najahid dynasty. He came to power during the second quarter of the fifth/eleventh century in Zabid (\'Umara 1985: 46 1. 10-47 1.1; Daghfous 1992-1993: 33)."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2589, 'temperature': 0.2})
